      "created_at": "2015-01-24T15:04:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You won and played within the rules. &nbsp;A similar scenario deals with Apostate. &nbsp;His flip condition says if he is reduced to 0 or fewer HP and still has a relic in play you flip him instead. &nbsp;Well using something like Sucker Punch allows you to defeat him and not flip. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
